<title>SINGAPORE: OCBC shares suspended for 1996 results.</title>
<headline>OCBC shares suspended for 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Oversea-Chinese Banking Corp Ltd (OCBC) will be suspended on Thursday at the bank's request pending announcement of the group's annual results, OCBC said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
